Cell["\<\
This is turned off by default as this operation Unprotects Series, which is \
potentially dangerous and might have unintended consequences. However we have \
not yet encountered any of them so far. The defaults of these values when the \
package is loaded can be changed by adding, e.g., the following to your init \
file:\
\>", "ExampleText",
